*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*%
*% ==========================================================================
*%  e-STUDIO 2323AM / 2823AM  —  CUPS PPD
*%
*%  本机型是 GDI（主机渲染）设备，没有 PCL/PS 解释器，所以页面必须在主机侧
*%  栅格化，由 rastertotoshiba 编码成厂商报文再交给 backend
*%  （socket:// 或 usb://）。
*%
*%  这是 CUPS 2.x 的经典 PPD + filter 模型。CUPS 3.x 已弃用此模型。
*%
*%  正常安装走 deb 包，不需要手工拷贝：
*%    sudo dpkg -i toshiba-estudio2323am_<ver>_<arch>.deb
*%    lpadmin -p 2323am -E -v socket://192.168.1.50:9100 \
*%            -m toshiba-estudio2323am.ppd
*% ==========================================================================
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "0.1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "TSB2323A.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "TOSHIBA"
*Product: "(e-STUDIO 2323AM)"
*ModelName: "TOSHIBA e-STUDIO 2323AM"
*ShortNickName: "TOSHIBA e-STUDIO 2323AM"
*NickName: "TOSHIBA e-STUDIO 2323AM, GDI, 600dpi (experimental)"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "23"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*% cupsFilter 的 MIME 类型决定上游给什么：这里要 CUPS raster，最省事。
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 0 rastertotoshiba"
*% filter 自己按 copies 循环发页，避免 CUPS 再复制一遍
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsVersion: 2.2

*OpenUI *PageSize/Page Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595.28 841.89]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A3/A3: "<</PageSize[841.89 1190.55]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A5/A5: "<</PageSize[419.53 595.28]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Page Region: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 40 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: A4
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595.28 841.89]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A3/A3: "<</PageSize[841.89 1190.55]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A5/A5: "<</PageSize[419.53 595.28]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*ImageableArea A4/A4: "18 18 577.28 823.89"
*ImageableArea A3/A3: "18 18 823.89 1172.55"
*ImageableArea A5/A5: "18 18 401.53 577.28"
*ImageableArea Letter/US Letter: "18 18 594 774"

*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*PaperDimension A4/A4: "595.28 841.89"
*PaperDimension A3/A3: "841.89 1190.55"
*PaperDimension A5/A5: "419.53 595.28"
*PaperDimension Letter/US Letter: "612 792"

*OpenUI *Resolution/Output Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 600dpi
*Resolution 600dpi/600 DPI: "<</HWResolution[600 600]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*%
*% 双面：本机已加装自动双面单元 MD-0107，属必支持功能（不是可选装饰）。
*% 但报文里 duplex 字段的位置/取值仍待抓包确认，见 docs/protocol-re.md 用例 9/10。
*% 默认仍是单面：协议未定时宁可打单面，也不要错送双面指令导致卡纸。
*%
*OpenUI *Duplex/2-Sided Printing: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 50 AnySetup *Duplex
*DefaultDuplex: None
*Duplex None/Off (1-Sided): ""
*Duplex DuplexNoTumble/Long-Edge Binding: ""
*Duplex DuplexTumble/Short-Edge Binding: ""
*CloseUI: *Duplex
*%
*% 刻意不提供纸盒选择（InputSlot）与介质类型（MediaType）：
*%   - 本机只有标配 250 张纸盒 + 100 张手送，没有加装 MY-1043-B 第二纸盒；
*%   - 这两类字段在私有报文里的位置尚未确认，暴露选项只会扩大逆向面。
*% 逆向需要强制指定时，用环境变量 TSB_SLOT / TSB_MEDIATYPE（见 src/cups_filter.c），
*% 不经过 PPD，不影响用户侧界面。协议确认后再决定是否加回 PPD。
*%


*OpenUI *TonerSave/Toner Save: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 50 AnySetup *TonerSave
*DefaultTonerSave: False
*TonerSave False/Off: ""
*TonerSave True/On: ""
*CloseUI: *TonerSave

*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(001.004)" Standard ROM
*DefaultFontSize: 12.0

*OpenGroup: General/General
*OpenUI *cupsEvenDuplex/Even Page Duplexing: Boolean
*DefaultcupsEvenDuplex: False
*cupsEvenDuplex False/Off: ""
*cupsEvenDuplex True/On: ""
*CloseUI: *cupsEvenDuplex
*CloseGroup: General

*% end of file
